OL,3,ARosenberg: Russia agrees to Ukraine
OL,4,Atalks but sees little to talk about in
OL,5,Anew peace push
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Oslo, the idea of a trilateral
OL,8,Fmeeting at leaders' level was floated.
OL,9,FThe hope was that Steve Witkoff's trip
OL,10,Fto Russia would pave the way for
OL,11,FPresident Vladimir Putin, Zelensky and
OL,12,FTrump to meet and agree an end to the
OL,13,Ffighting.
OL,15,FBut Putin has shown little desire to
OL,16,Fshare a table with Zelensky - unless
OL,17,Fthat table is in Moscow.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
